  "text": "BluePearl Pittsburgh South | Washington, PA\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Pittsburgh South Washington, PA\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nPittsburgh South\nWashington, PA\nSpecialty and After-Hours Emergency\n724.809.2000\n1535 Washington Rd.\nWashington, PA 15301\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\nSun 7 am-Fri 5 pm\nUrgent care:\nFri: 7 am-5 pm\nSpecialty:\nMon-Fri: 7 am-4 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nNOTICE: Emergency services at our hospital transition to urgent care on Fridays from 9 am to 5 pm.\nIf your pet needs emergency or urgent care, please call the hospital so we can talk you through your pet’s situation and help you get the best care possible.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Pittsburgh South – serving Washington and southern Pittsburgh.\nWe are located in Washington, Pennsylvania, and we serve pets and their families in the greater Pittsburgh area, including the southern suburbs.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead to let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Pittsburgh South.\nFormerly known as Pittsburgh Veterinary Specialty & Emergency Center (PVSEC), our 13,500-square-foot hospital opened in the summer of 2017. We are fully equipped as an emergency animal hospital and as a center for advanced specialty care.\nOur sister hospital,\nBluePearl Pet Hospital North Hills\n, is one of the largest and most comprehensive emergency and specialty hospitals in western Pennsylvania, but our Washington hospital is more convenient to many communities south of Pittsburgh.\nWe use sophisticated diagnostic equipment such as a 64-slice CT scanner and video endoscopy and have dedicated suites for endoscopy and ultrasound.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our Washington hospital team at\n724.809.2000\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n724.809.2000\n1535 Washington Rd.\nWashington,\nPA                                    15301\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Pittsburgh North\nPittsburgh, PA\n807 Camp Horne Rd.\nPittsburgh, PA 15237\n412.366.3400\n21.97 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nMonroeville, PA\n4224 Northern Pike\nMonroeville, PA 15146\n412.810.6732\n27.26 miles\nSkylos Sports Medicine\nFredrick, MD\n434 Prospect 